# The Illusion type and the sacrifice ability are part of Phantasmal Image's copiable values (CR 707.9b, and the card's
# 2017-03-14 ruling), so a Phyrexian Metamorph that copies the Image is an artifact Guerrilla Gorilla that is also an
# Illusion and has "When this creature becomes the target of a spell or ability, sacrifice it". Bot2's Bolt at the
# Metamorph sacrifices it and is countered for want of a target (CR 608.2b); the Image itself, never targeted, stays.

